ix.net/cfa87540/uploads/origins/34886f6f-378c-4e72-9f5e-438ec44e31a3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=96549d719403b336911237a84ba3b8a0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/cfa87540/uploads/origins/34886f6f-378c-4e72-9f5e-438ec44e31a3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=59d6648b0a85a558d2a5f984007b9bfb 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "ふうめ様、はじめまして！\nできれば、私のVtuberキャラを依頼してもよろしいですか？\n\nSea bunny(ゴマフビロードウミウシ)をモチーフにしたキャラです。\nキャラが海や、グミキャンディや、ゲームをすることや、TRPGや、ウミウシなど好き。\nポーズなどはご自由にお決めください。\nTwitchとSNSとかで使いたいです！m(_ _)m\n\nご検討のほど、何卒よろしくお願い致します。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1lA04qMLsx-eflkq260GG2z6WNPRgxuSd?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@huume0/works/36", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2c56f519/uploads/origins/9c5c3afd-1cd3-477e-90fb-3ffe520c4a33?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=66c7b57dead2f8e7dae5ca46a6afc109", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2c56f519/uploads/origins/9c5c3afd-1cd3-477e-90fb-3ffe520c4a33?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=66c7b57dead2f8e7dae5ca46a6afc109, https://si.imgix.net/2c56f519/uploads/origins/9c5c3afd-1cd3-477e-90fb-3ffe520c4a33?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c079acae7c382a742bc1867ef73f2873 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2c56f519/uploads/origins/9c5c3afd-1cd3-477e-90fb-3ffe520c4a33?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d7e6fad71e1c6d460d07a66e6c42d9f1 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello!\nI think your art is so cute! \nIf it is okay, I'd love to get a reference sheet of my character.\nThis is my character:\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1TYaN1DRjuBItJl0gqYs_UIYu7v4-EMd6\n\nHer name is Setsuna. She is a wish-granting angel who thinks she is an alien. She speaks really slowly and has droopy, sleepy eyes. \n\nPlease note the characteristics in this image:\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1e6ybnVXRKVp32TITl4xb8QarabN5ZA-R/view\nShe has rounded bangs. Her black bows have a white puffball in the center and her headset has a microphone and cord attached (https://drive.google.com/file/d/1HKLC8OMbKgZfKqj00lVBP4ul_CWNnVny/view).  The end of the cord, the jack, is shaped like a heart.\n\nPlease note that she also has low-hanging pigtails. They are towards the middle of her head.\nShe also has small angel wings behind her. She has a small bandage on her knee, with slouchy socks.\n\nIf you do draw a back view, she has a small white puffball tail (like a bunny) on the back of her cardigan, with a small red heart emblem beside it. (like this: https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1140/8354/products/JOH-32-CB03-FUN-CB_1800x.jpg?v=1647684923)\n\nIf it is okay, I would like for the traits to be listed beside them, for example: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1RqZ9lBVCYwytqR4O9PuyvCCK0XISz5Cn/view\n \nIt is okay to put them in Japanese! This will be a reference for future commissions.\n\nThank you very much, I look forward to it! I am so sorry for all of the writing.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@huume0/works/35", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/284b09d3/uploads/origins/2956e9c4-a69e-478c-9c78-bfe892a6edb4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f10d08ad7e5dfb36f3ae5de5c29a6af3", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/284b09d3/uploads/origins/2956e9c4-a69e-478c-9c78-bfe892a6edb4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f10d08ad7e5dfb36f3ae5de5c29a6af3, https://si.imgix.net/284b09d3/uploads/origins/2956e9c4-a69e-478c-9c78-bfe892a6edb4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d0a081fbc63b5d2c6db2b1fc7dcf1cce 2x, https://si.imgix.net/284b09d3/uploads/origins/2956e9c4-a69e-478c-9c78-bfe892a6edb4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=01c7a0f1cfb99ebbda5ad144775c4dcd 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "ふうめさんのイラストをお見かけして、\nとても可愛かったのでイラストをお願いしたいです。\n\n描いて頂きたいのはVRChatで使用しているアバターです。\nニコニコの笑顔より、悪戯の前のクソガキ小悪魔のイメージで描いて頂けると嬉しいです。\n\nTwitterのヘッダーやアイコン\nVRChatの自宅ワールドに飾ったり、Tシャツにしてアバターに着せたいと思っています。\nよろしくお願いします！\n※個人使用の為、商用利用しません\n\n服装やポーズなどは自由にかいてもらって大丈夫です！\n\nhttps://proximal-crop-d5b.notion.site/20eb6211bcdc4b3b910d709ec68d48e4", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}